<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cause Light Wounds</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Healer (guild level 1), Necromancer (guild level 1), Dark Knight (guild level 10)
Mana: 10
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cause light wounds &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cause light wounds</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>By praying to your god, you make wounds open on the target with a touch. The 
better your divine power and sphere, the deeper they go.
</p><p>Being a touch, it gets through heavy armour best: it does most against plate, 
and least against clothes. A shield can block it. Casting it is an attack and 
starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Serious Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Harm</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Deathly Grasp</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>